ss&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aIuuA1uOke0Q7kNvwEohgbd&_nc_oc=AdohxbCmW86VlVnDkEtKO3B5l1_bk3-YfEbPXpbuP0vmKgv_I55s-o29bTdkESK7PdA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQu-qZGe69kezNNbAjPa0cmVk5vhZTeREIdHphnRLataQ&oe=6B01D5CA"}, {"file_name": "buggy.png", "id": "1627087928239307", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031529_1627087931572640_4083118609254979821_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4lyj5LKieYUQ7kNvwF3HKh8&_nc_oc=AdrhxNeNKeqlYroLyml_Yk4neQdGnSZJhsRZ2NyXTAJOZNEIGv60KUtbTtoE1jx3tsM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ2M5J9nuoLh2qaO0Pa4a-kgvFbLxEYW-iJiIla6O6H2w&oe=6B01BF80"}, {"file_name": "bowling_escavation.png", "id": "1076453430688828", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974746_1076453434022161_3902000793864200888_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NFCkbP-1I14Q7kNvwF2j3y3&_nc_oc=Adq28q78ePNqrTHw9Rn_QBZMd-MP7Oi9aUVDO6Gp9oAD-DySCZsw4haunBxzzg5d0BE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTryOhRzQ6nxlOdn7pcySrujQn_I_2EXZRYDV3AZgNaiw&oe=6B01C94F"}, {"file_name": "asteroid_scanning.png", "id": "1708518839722580", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75303839_1708518843055913_8867692545714880265_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P5wQAx2CcOIQ7kNvwF7iu91&_nc_oc=AdpzchGjDDkh1w_lAU2WhOLTKxLPRdicdbg3WD5NJwkMQWdlIUYhzROMw0B1p_Q5D0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSrbNt7t1WH3QtVxuF7nU0H1tsEwOZzH7-HYWiaaeIZ3g&oe=6B01CD4D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_ASP_CoverImage.png", "id": "865693635411839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031309_865693638745172_2747540183598569721_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-9oxPoLONh4Q7kNvwGJ3zAb&_nc_oc=AdqL5bssIBGO2QZ4JAdoKp_USazBTUPR8_D7I8a3GUmcRQRWunaX5fr1rvfkucvW1lo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR8j7rIPkk47QOEUN7j_NCusm6YL1-cViKpU0MBkY6f-g&oe=6B01B7CD"}, "display_name": "A Space Pawdyssey", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Embark on A Space Pawdyssey!\n\nYou play **Astra**, a smart, sweet and ambitious husky, sent on a space exploration mission by the human-led organization called PAWSA.\n\nAstra is joined by a quirky team of companions **SBURD**, a deranged goose that only communicates through honks and unsettling stares; **Albert the XV**, a cynical and well-educated monkey, that is also the team\u2019s weapon expert; and **Luna**, an adorable, but slightly neurotic mouse suffering from space allergies and a massive crush on the goose.\n{949438840336802}\n\n\n The team is tasked with traveling to two mysterious planets to collect three vital ingredients for analysis, providing insights into newly discovered celestial bodies. \n{606909931764369}\n\n\nAlong the way, they face a series of **wild adventures** and **chaotic disasters**: \n{413392028505368}\n\nLuna gets launched across the first planet by an uncontrollable sneezing fit, a **meteor shower** pummels the second planet, and a **space battle** erupts with French cat astronauts. \n\nFrom **reactor reboots** to electrical malfunctions and the unclogging of the ship\u2019s engines after a vicious **chicken \"bowel movement\" attack**, this crew has to master it all.\n\n{549656377922356}\nThese adrenaline-packed challenges are paired with fun **puzzle** and **rhythm-based** mini-games, which serve as the key to experimenting with the collected ingredients.\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Join the space pack and embark on a high-stakes cosmic adventure: Battle meteor storms, rival feline-astronauts, and chaotic mishaps like sneezing fits and questionable chicken sabotage. Solve puzzles, play rhythm mini-games, and explore newly discovered planets!!"}]}, "developer_name"